{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function getIsKeyHeld(key): SvelteHeldKeyState;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getIsKeyHeld.svelte.ts#L66","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getIsKeyHeld.svelte.ts:66"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte function that returns reactive access to whether a specific key is currently being held."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function uses the global KeyStateTracker and updates whenever keys are pressed\nor released."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IndividualKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The key to check (e.g., 'Shift', 'Control', 'A')"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/SvelteHeldKeyState.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SvelteHeldKeyState"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Object with a reactive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"held"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script>\n  import { getIsKeyHeld } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const isShiftHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Shift')\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  {isShiftHeld.held ? 'Shift is pressed!' : 'Press Shift'}\n</div>","lang":"svelte"},{"type":"code","value":"<script>\n  import { getIsKeyHeld } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const isCtrlHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Control')\n  const isShiftHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Shift')\n  const isAltHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Alt')\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  <span style:opacity={isCtrlHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Ctrl</span>\n  <span style:opacity={isShiftHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Shift</span>\n  <span style:opacity={isAltHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Alt</span>\n</div>","lang":"svelte"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"key","text":"key","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction getIsKeyHeld(key): SvelteHeldKeyState;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getIsKeyHeld.svelte.ts:66](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getIsKeyHeld.svelte.ts#L66)\n\nSvelte function that returns reactive access to whether a specific key is currently being held.\n\nThis function uses the global KeyStateTracker and updates whenever keys are pressed\nor released.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### key\n\n`IndividualKey`\n\nThe key to check (e.g., 'Shift', 'Control', 'A')\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SvelteHeldKeyState`](../interfaces/SvelteHeldKeyState.md)\n\nObject with a reactive `held` property\n\n## Examples\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  import { getIsKeyHeld } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const isShiftHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Shift')\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  {isShiftHeld.held ? 'Shift is pressed!' : 'Press Shift'}\n</div>\n```\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  import { getIsKeyHeld } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const isCtrlHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Control')\n  const isShiftHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Shift')\n  const isAltHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Alt')\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  <span style:opacity={isCtrlHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Ctrl</span>\n  <span style:opacity={isShiftHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Shift</span>\n  <span style:opacity={isAltHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Alt</span>\n</div>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: getIsKeyHeld\ntitle: getIsKeyHeld\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction getIsKeyHeld(key): SvelteHeldKeyState;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getIsKeyHeld.svelte.ts:66](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getIsKeyHeld.svelte.ts#L66)\n\nSvelte function that returns reactive access to whether a specific key is currently being held.\n\nThis function uses the global KeyStateTracker and updates whenever keys are pressed\nor released.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### key\n\n`IndividualKey`\n\nThe key to check (e.g., 'Shift', 'Control', 'A')\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SvelteHeldKeyState`](../interfaces/SvelteHeldKeyState.md)\n\nObject with a reactive `held` property\n\n## Examples\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  import { getIsKeyHeld } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const isShiftHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Shift')\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  {isShiftHeld.held ? 'Shift is pressed!' : 'Press Shift'}\n</div>\n```\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  import { getIsKeyHeld } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const isCtrlHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Control')\n  const isShiftHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Shift')\n  const isAltHeld = getIsKeyHeld('Alt')\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  <span style:opacity={isCtrlHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Ctrl</span>\n  <span style:opacity={isShiftHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Shift</span>\n  <span style:opacity={isAltHeld.held ? 1 : 0.3}>Alt</span>\n</div>\n```\n"}
